/-!
# Table of the rounded future costs, levels 8 to 14

For `8 ≤ h ≤ 14` and `0 ≤ J < 2^15` this file records the value `10^8 cf⁺_h(3^J)` of the
rounded future cost at the point `3^J`, as lane `J mod 256` (of width `32`) of the packed
number of index `⌊J / 256⌋` of level `h`. The values are certified by
`CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeSpec`.

## Main definitions

* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel8`: the packed values of level `8`.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel9`: the packed values of level `9`.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel10`: the packed values of level `10`.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel11`: the packed values of level `11`.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel12`: the packed values of level `12`.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel13`: the packed values of level `13`.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel14`: the packed values of level `14`.
-/

set_option linter.style.longLine false

@[expose] public section

